WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.159 --> 00:00:08.180
If one wishes to find the gold of life, they
must be willing to dig and sift through the

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:10.580
dirt.

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:17.210
When thinking about life, it becomes very
easy to drown in its immense complexity and

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:18.259
uncertainty.

00:00:18.259 --> 00:00:25.210
It becomes appealing to just claim ignorance
and pretend like such complexity does not

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:27.140
exist.

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:32.070
But pretending that life is simple does not
make it so.

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:40.030
Regardless of how much one may try, no one
can be completely numb to the effects of life.

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:47.219
The only real way to simplify life is by following
it down its path of complexity.

00:00:47.219 --> 00:00:51.559
We must not run from its intricate and elusive
nature.

00:00:51.559 --> 00:00:55.059
We must, instead, accept and embrace it.

00:00:55.059 --> 00:00:57.699
Only then can we break life down into small
enough pieces to understand.

00:00:57.699 --> 00:01:02.329
Consider the basic food ingredient, a tomato.

00:01:02.329 --> 00:01:07.330
Think about how many edible applications there
are for a tomato.

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:09.040
You can eat it whole.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:13.630
You can cut it up into big chunks and put
it on a salad.

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:18.140
You can slice it into small slivers and put
it on a burger.

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:24.190
You can dice it and put it in soup or on top
of a chicken meal.

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:30.670
You can smash it up and make it into a sauce
for a pasta meal, or pizza, or a sandwich.

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:35.670
You can blend it with the addition of other
ingredients and make it into ketchup or a

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.360
soup broth.

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:45.239
The recipes and applications for a tomato
are endless, but one can only uncover them

00:01:45.239 --> 00:01:48.470
if they break the tomato down.

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:54.890
The more one breaks it down into smaller and
smaller pieces, the more usages the tomato

00:01:54.890 --> 00:02:01.470
has and the easier it is to manipulate into
different meals.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:03.700
Life works the same way.

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:09.899
Individuals who are willing to cut up, break
down, and analyze complicated thoughts and

00:02:09.899 --> 00:02:20.170
ideas are able to turn them into delicious
meals in the form of solutions, art, or understanding.

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:27.750
All things in life do not require over-complication,
but it is the fear of facing the things that

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:33.950
do that prevents legitimate simplification
and well-being.

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:40.940
It is this fear that leaves us hopelessly
lost from who can be and what we can experience

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:42.390
in life.

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:45.810
It is this fear that we must overcome.

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:57.709
It is the tomato that we must cut through.

